    Calculates the Return on Investment (ROI) percentage.
    
    Args:
        initial_capex (float): The initial capital expenditure (investment).
        annual_savings (float): Yearly operational savings from the improvement.
        project_lifespan (int): Expected duration of the project in years.
        
    Returns:
        float: ROI percentage.
    """
